  ${
    3imtr4d.1 $e |- ( ph -> ( ps -> ch ) ) $.
    3imtr4d.2 $e |- ( ph -> ( th <-> ps ) ) $.
    3imtr4d.3 $e |- ( ph -> ( ta <-> ch ) ) $.
    $( More general version of ~ 3imtr4i .  Useful for converting conditional
