  ${
    3imtr3g.1 $e |- ( ph -> ( ps -> ch ) ) $.
    3imtr3g.2 $e |- ( ps <-> th ) $.
    3imtr3g.3 $e |- ( ch <-> ta ) $.
    $( More general version of ~ 3imtr3i .  Useful for converting definitions
