    3bitr3rd $p |- ( ph -> ( ta <-> th ) ) $=
      ( bitr3d ) ACEDHABCDFGII $.
  $}

  ${
    3bitr4d.1 $e |- ( ph -> ( ps <-> ch ) ) $.
    3bitr4d.2 $e |- ( ph -> ( th <-> ps ) ) $.
    3bitr4d.3 $e |- ( ph -> ( ta <-> ch ) ) $.
    $( Deduction from transitivity of biconditional.  Useful for converting
