  ${
    3bitr3g.1 $e |- ( ph -> ( ps <-> ch ) ) $.
    3bitr3g.2 $e |- ( ps <-> th ) $.
    3bitr3g.3 $e |- ( ch <-> ta ) $.
    $( More general version of ~ 3bitr3i .  Useful for converting definitions
