    impd $p |- ( ph -> ( ( ps /\ ch ) -> th ) ) $=
      ( wa wi com3l imp com12 ) BCFADBCADGABCDEHIJ $.

    $( Importation deduction with commuted antecedents.  (Contributed by Peter
