  $}

  ${
    mp3an23.1 $e |- ps $.
    mp3an23.2 $e |- ch $.
    mp3an23.3 $e |- ( ( ph /\ ps /\ ch ) -> th ) $.
    $( An inference based on modus ponens.  (Contributed by NM,
