    $.

  $( Theorem 19.18 of [Margaris] p. 90.  (Contributed by NM, 5-Aug-1993.) $)
  exbi $p |- ( A. x ( ph <-> ps ) -> ( E. x ph <-> E. x ps ) ) $=
