       shortened by Jim Kingdon, 15-Jan-2018.) $)
    sb8e $p |- ( E. x ph <-> E. y [ y / x ] ph ) $=
      ( wsb nfs1 sbequ12 cbvex ) AABCEBCDABCDFABCGH $.
  $}


