    nfab $p |- F/_ x { y | ph } $=
      ( vz cab nfsab nfci ) BEACFABCEDGH $.
  $}

  $( Bound-variable hypothesis builder for a class abstraction.  (Contributed
     by Mario Carneiro, 14-Oct-2016.) $)
  nfaba1 $p |- F/_ x { y | A. x ph } $=
    ( wal nfa1 nfab ) ABDBCABEF $.

  ${
    $d x z $.  $d y z $.  $d z A $.  $d z B $.
