    rabbia2 $p |- { x e. A | ps } = { x e. B | ch } $=
      ( crab wceq wtru cv wcel wa wb a1i rabbidva2 mptru ) ACDGBCEGHIABCDECJZDK
      ALQEKBLMIFNOP $.
