    sbcth2.1 $e |- ( x e. B -> ph ) $.
    $( A substitution into a theorem.  (Contributed by NM, 1-Mar-2008.)  (Proof
       shortened by Mario Carneiro, 13-Oct-2016.) $)
    sbcth2 $p |- ( A e. B -> [. A / x ]. ph ) $=
