        wo exmiddc ) EADAMZEANBDJABDOZEAFAFGUAZPUIAUJFAFGUBQHRSTEUHNCDKUHCDOZEU
        HGUJPUKUHUJGAFGUCQIRSTEAUDAUHUFLAUGRUE $.
    $}

    $( A wff ` th ` containing a conditional operator is true when both of its
