  ${
    $d A y $.  $d ph y $.  $d x y $.
    $( An inhabited iota expression has a unique value.  (Contributed by Jim
       Kingdon, 22-Nov-2024.) $)
    eliotaeu $p |- ( A e. ( iota x ph ) -> E! x ph ) $=
