       hypothesis for ` E ` instead of distinct variable conditions as in
       ~ opeliunxp2 .  (Contributed by AV, 25-Oct-2020.) $)
    opeliunxp2f $p |- ( <. C , D >. e. U_ x e. A ( { x } X. B ) <->
