      ( wbr wa wer adantr simpr ersym impbida ) ABCDGZCBDGZANHBCDEAEDIZNFJANKLA
      OHCBDEAPOFJAOKLM $.

    $( An equivalence relation is transitive.  (Contributed by NM, 4-Jun-1995.)
