      ancoms expcom anim2d adantr syl2an an4s adantl 3imtr4d ssrdv ) ACHZBDHZIZ
      CEJZDFJZIZIZGABKLZCDKLZUSGMZNZVBBAOZHZIZVCVBDCOZHZIZVBUTJZVBVAJZUOVFVIPUR
      UOVEVHVCUOVDVGHZVEVHPUNUMVLBDACUAUDVEVLVHVBVDVGUBUEUCUFUGUMUPUNUQVJVFQZUM
      UPIARJBRJVMUNUQIACESBDFSABVBRRTUHUIURVKVIQUOCDVBEFTUJUKUL $.
  $}

  ${
    $d f x y $.
    $( Elementhood of a restricted function in the set of partial functions.
       (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 31-Dec-2013.) $)
    pmresg $p |- ( ( B e. V /\ F e. ( A ^pm C ) ) ->
                 ( F |` B ) e. ( A ^pm B ) ) $=
      ( vx vy vf wcel cpm co wa cvv cres wf cv wfun adantl wss wceq cdm cin cxp
      cpw crab df-pm elmpocl1 simpl elpmi simpld inss1 fssres sylancl ffun wrel
      resres funrel resdm reseq1 3syl eqtr3id feq1d mpbid inss2 elpm2r syl21anc
      mpanr2 ) BEIZDACJKIZLZAMIZVHDUAZBUBZADBNZOZVNABJKIZVIVKVHFGMMHPQHGPFPUCUD
      UEACJDFGHUFUGRVHVIUHVJVMADVMNZOZVOVJVLADOZVMVLSVRVIVSVHVIVSVLCSACDUIUJRZV
      LBUKVLAVMDULUMVJVMAVQVNVJVSDQZVQVNTVTVLADUNWAVQDVLNZBNZVNDVLBUPWADUOWBDTW
      CVNTDUQDURWBDBUSUTVAUTVBVCVKVHLVOVMBSVPVLBVDABVMVNMEVEVGVF $.
  $}

  ${
    $d g A $.  $d f g B $.  $d g F $.
    elmap.1 $e |- A e. _V $.
    elmap.2 $e |- B e. _V $.
    $( Membership relation for set exponentiation.  (Contributed by NM,
       8-Dec-2003.) $)
    elmap $p |- ( F e. ( A ^m B ) <-> F : B --> A ) $=
      ( cvv wcel cmap co wf wb elmapg mp2an ) AFGBFGCABHIGBACJKDEABCFFLM $.

    $( Alternate expression for the value of set exponentiation.  (Contributed
       by NM, 3-Nov-2007.) $)
    mapval2 $p |- ( A ^m B ) = ( ~P ( B X. A ) i^i { f | f Fn B } ) $=
      ( vg cmap co cxp cpw cv wfn cab cin wf wss wa wcel dff2 bitri ancom elmap
      elin velpw vex fneq1 elab anbi12i 3bitr4i eqriv ) FABGHZBAIZJZCKZBLZCMZNZ
      BAFKZOZURULPZURBLZQZURUKRURUQRZUSVAUTQVBBAURSVAUTUATABURDEUBVCURUMRZURUPR
      ZQVBURUMUPUCVDUTVEVAFULUDUOVACURFUEBUNURUFUGUHTUIUJ $.

    $( The predicate "is a partial function".  (Contributed by NM,
