$(
###############################################################################
  CHOICE PRINCIPLES
###############################################################################

  We have already introduced the full Axiom of Choice ~ df-ac but since it
  implies excluded middle as shown at ~ exmidac , it is not especially
  relevant to us.  In this section we define countable choice and dependent
  choice, which are not as strong as thus often considered in mathematics
  which seeks to avoid full excluded middle.

$)


