  $( The nonnegative fraction constant 0. $)
  c0q0 $a class 0Q0 $.
  $( Nonnegative fraction addition. $)
  cplq0 $a class +Q0 $.
  $( Nonnegative fraction multiplication. $)
  cmq0 $a class .Q0 $.

  $( Extend class notation with new sets (constants) used in construction of
