     numbers, derived from set theory.  (This restates ~ ax-pre-ltadd with
     ordering on the extended reals.)  (Contributed by NM, 13-Oct-2005.) $)
  axltadd $p |- ( ( A e. RR /\ B e. RR /\ C e. RR ) ->
