      ( cc wcel caddc co cmin wceq pnpcan syl3anc ) ABHICHIDHIBCJKBDJKLKCDLKMEF
      GBCDNO $.

    $( Cancellation law for mixed addition and subtraction.  (Contributed by
       Mario Carneiro, 27-May-2016.) $)
