    ltadd1d $p |- ( ph -> ( A < B <-> ( A + C ) < ( B + C ) ) ) $=
      ( cr wcel clt wbr caddc co wb ltadd1 syl3anc ) ABHICHIDHIBCJKBDLMCDLMJKNE
      FGBCDOP $.

    $( Addition to both sides of 'less than or equal to'.  (Contributed by
