      ( cr wcel cle wbr caddc co wb leadd1 syl3anc ) ABHICHIDHIBCJKBDLMCDLMJKNE
      FGBCDOP $.

    $( Addition to both sides of 'less than or equal to'.  (Contributed by
       Mario Carneiro, 27-May-2016.) $)
    leadd2d $p |- ( ph -> ( A <_ B <-> ( C + A ) <_ ( C + B ) ) ) $=
