        -> ( ( A / C ) = B <-> ( C x. B ) = A ) ) $=
      ( vx cc wcel cc0 cap wbr wa w3a cdiv co wceq cv cmul 3expb 3adant2 eqeq1d
      crio divvalap wreu wb simp2 receuap oveq2 riota2 syl2anc bitr4d ) AEFZBEF
