    IBCJKADLM $.

  $( Half of a number is zero iff the number is zero.  (Contributed by NM,
     20-Apr-2006.) $)
  half0 $p |- ( A e. CC -> ( ( A / 2 ) = 0 <-> A = 0 ) ) $=
    ( cc wcel c2 cc0 cap wbr cdiv co wceq wb 2cn 2ap0 diveqap0 mp3an23 ) ABCDBC
    DEFGADHIEJAEJKLMADNO $.

