    $( A number times 2.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro, 27-May-2016.) $)
    times2d $p |- ( ph -> ( A x. 2 ) = ( A + A ) ) $=
      ( cc wcel c2 cmul co caddc wceq times2 syl ) ABDEBFGHBBIHJCBKL $.

