      ZJZVTWQJZPZWPWAOWKWDWRWEWSWKVLWQVSAWJUMZRWKVLWQVTXARUPWPWTWAWPWRWSWAVSVTW
      JIIWHWIWJUQDSESURVDUSUTTVAVBVCVEVFVAVGVHTVIVJVK $.

    $( A function with a domain containing (at least) two different elements is
