      wrex oveq2d feq2d mpbird rexlimiva sylbi ) BADEFCGZHIZABJZCKRFBLMZHIZABJZ
      ABCNUFUICKUDKEZUFOZUIUFUJUFPUKUHUEABUKUGUDFHABUDQSTUAUBUC $.
