  wrdfn $p |- ( W e. Word S -> W Fn ( 0 ..^ ( # ` W ) ) ) $=
    ( cword wcel cc0 chash cfv cfzo co wrdf ffnd ) BACDEBFGHIABABJK $.

  $( A word over an alphabet is a word over the universal class.  (Contributed
