      ( cc wcel cim cfv cr imcl syl ) ABDEBFGHECBIJ $.

    $( Closure law for complex conjugate.  (Contributed by Mario Carneiro,
       29-May-2016.) $)
    cjcld $p |- ( ph -> ( * ` A ) e. CC ) $=
