       (Contributed by Paul Chapman, 21-Mar-2011.) $)
    df-dvds $a |- || = { <. x , y >. | ( ( x e. ZZ /\ y e. ZZ ) /\
                                            E. n e. ZZ ( n x. x ) = y ) } $.
