                  ( P e. NN /\ { n e. NN | n || P } ~~ 2o ) ) $=
      ( vp cv cdvds wbr cn crab c2o cen cprime wceq breq2 rabbidv breq1d df-prm
      elrab2 ) BDZCDZEFZBGHZIJFRAEFZBGHZIJFCAGKSALZUAUCIJUDTUBBGSAREMNOBCPQ $.

