        SKAFDNTUA $.

      $( A constructed tuple is a point in a structure product iff each
         coordinate is in the proper base set.  (Contributed by Stefan O'Rear,
         10-Jan-2015.) $)
      prdsbasmpt $p |- ( ph -> ( ( x e. I |-> U ) e. B <->
          A. x e. I U e. ( Base ` ( R ` x ) ) ) ) $=
