           ~ dffn5im to establish equalities.  (Contributed by Stefan O'Rear,
           10-Jan-2015.) $)
        prdsbasfn $p |- ( ph -> T Fn I ) $=
          ( vx cv cfv cbs cixp wcel wfn prdsbas2 eleqtrd ixpfn syl ) AEPFPQCRSR
          ZTZUAEFUBAEBUHOAPBCDFGHIJKLMNUCUDPFUGEUEUF $.

