    ( ctop wcel c0 cuni uni0 wss 0ss uniopn mpan2 eqeltrrid ) ABCZDDEZAFLDAGMAC
    AHDAIJK $.

  $( The empty set is not a topology.  (Contributed by FL, 1-Jun-2008.) $)
