      ( ctopon cfv wcel ctop topontop ax-mp ) BADEFBGFCABHI $.

    $( The base set of a topology on a given base set.  (Contributed by Mario
       Carneiro, 13-Aug-2015.) $)
    toponunii $p |- B = U. J $=
      ( ctopon cfv wcel cuni wceq toponuni ax-mp ) BADEFABGHCABIJ $.
  $}

  ${
    toptopon.1 $e |- X = U. J $.
    $( Alternative definition of ` Top ` in terms of ` TopOn ` .  (Contributed
       by Mario Carneiro, 13-Aug-2015.) $)
    toptopon $p |- ( J e. Top <-> J e. ( TopOn ` X ) ) $=
      ( ctopon cfv wcel ctop cuni wceq istopon mpbiran2 bicomi ) ABDEFZAGFZMNBA
      HICBAJKL $.
