      QBOHZUSABPVAIQZTCIGZHUSIRUAVBIUBUCRIUDUEVATBVCBUFEUGTCIUHUISUQBUJZALZUTUQ
      AVDNVEABUKVDAULSBAUMUNABURCDEUOUP $.

    $( If the topology component is already correctly truncated, then it forms
