      QPIQABCKDBLMN $.

    $( The complement of a closed set is open.  (Contributed by NM,
       5-Oct-2006.)  (Revised by Stefan O'Rear, 22-Feb-2015.) $)
    cldopn $p |- ( S e. ( Clsd ` J ) -> ( X \ S ) e. J ) $=
      ( ctop wcel ccld cfv cdif cldrcl wss iscld simplbda mpancom ) BEFZABGHFZC
      AIBFZABJOPACKQABCDLMN $.

    $( The difference of a closed set with an open set is open.  (Contributed
       by Mario Carneiro, 6-Jan-2014.) $)
    difopn $p |- ( ( A e. J /\ B e. ( Clsd ` J ) ) -> ( A \ B ) e. J ) $=
      ( wcel ccld cfv wa cin cdif wss wceq elssuni sseqtrrdi adantr df-ss sylib
      cuni adantl difeq1d indif2 cldrcl simpl cldopn syl3anc eqeltrrid eqeltrrd
      ctop inopn ) ACFZBCGHFZIZADJZBKZABKCUMUNABUMADLZUNAMUKUPULUKACSDACNEOPADQ
      RUAUMUOADBKZJZCADBUBUMCUIFZUKUQCFZURCFULUSUKBCUCTUKULUDULUTUKBCDEUETAUQCU
      JUFUGUH $.

    $( The underlying set of a topology is closed.  Part of Theorem 6.1(1) of
       [Munkres] p. 93.  (Contributed by NM, 3-Oct-2006.) $)
    topcld $p |- ( J e. Top -> X e. ( Clsd ` J ) ) $=
      ( ctop wcel ccld cfv wss cdif wa c0 difid 0opn eqeltrid ssid jctil mpbird
      iscld ) ADEZBAFGEBBHZBBIZAEZJSUBTSUAKABLAMNBOPBABCRQ $.

    $( The interior of a subset of a topology's base set is the union of all
       the open sets it includes.  Definition of interior of [Munkres] p. 94.
       (Contributed by NM, 10-Sep-2006.)  (Revised by Mario Carneiro,
       11-Nov-2013.) $)
    ntrval $p |- ( ( J e. Top /\ S C_ X ) -> ( ( int ` J ) ` S ) =
                 U. ( J i^i ~P S ) ) $=
      ( vx ctop wcel wss wa cnt cfv cpw cv cin cuni cmpt wceq adantr cvv syl wb
      ntrfval fveq1d eqid pweq ineq2d unieqd topopn elpw2g biimpar inex1g eqtrd
      uniexg fvmptd3 ) BFGZACHZIZABJKZKZAECLZBEMZLZNZOZPZKZBALZNZOZUOUSVFQUPUOA
      URVEEBCDUBUCRUQEAVDVIUTVESVEUDVAAQZVCVHVJVBVGBVAAUEUFUGUOAUTGZUPUOCBGVKUP
      UABCDUHACBUITUJUQVHSGZVISGUOVLUPBVGFUKRVHSUMTUNUL $.

    $( The closure of a subset of a topology's base set is the intersection of
       all the closed sets that include it.  Definition of closure of [Munkres]
