      cxp cmap crab cmpt mptrel df-met releqi mpbir ) FGAHBIZCIZDIZJZKLUHUILMUK
      EIZUHUJJULUIUJJNJOPEAIZQRCUMQBUMQDSUMUMTUAJUBZUCZGAHUNUDFUOABCEDUEUFUG $.

    $( The class of extended metrics is a relation.  (Contributed by Jim
       Kingdon, 20-Apr-2023.) $)
    xmetrel $p |- Rel *Met $=
      ( ve vx vy vd vz cxmet wrel cvv cv co cc0 wceq wb cxad cle wbr wa cxr cxp
      wral cmap crab cmpt mptrel df-xmet releqi mpbir ) FGAHBIZCIZDIZJZKLUHUILM
      UKEIZUHUJJULUIUJJNJOPEAIZTQCUMTBUMTDRUMUMSUAJUBZUCZGAHUNUDFUOABCEDUEUFUG
      $.
