       but the edges from both graphs are kept, maybe resulting in two edges
       between two vertices).  (Contributed by Alexander van der Vekens,
       10-Aug-2017.)  (Revised by AV, 16-Oct-2020.)  (Revised by AV,
       24-Oct-2021.) $)
