     22-Jul-2026.) $)
  df-ralseu $a |- ( AE! x e. A ( ph -> ps ) <->
      ( A. x e. A ( ph -> ps ) /\ E! x e. A ph ) ) $.

  $( The bounded "all some one" form is the general form with the class
